OpenCluely Overlay 2.1
Based on arth-agrawal/OpenCluely and the original TechyCSR/OpenCluely.
The Apache-2.0 LICENSE is retained in this repository. The original source
remains available from the upstream repositories and this repository's Git history.

This version replaces the desktop entry point with a focused text/image overlay,
new lifecycle management, provider transport, secure storage and interface.
The earlier voice and other interfaces are available in
Git history for reference and are not included in the new desktop distribution.

ChatGPT account and Codex connection support is adapted from
luffy-taro-106/opencluely-overlay commits 723ad56 and 8527e3a.
The distribution includes OpenAI Codex CLI 0.164.0, licensed under Apache-2.0:
https://github.com/openai/codex

Closed Cluely 1.0 is derived from OpenCluely Overlay 2.5.1. It removes quit
protection and automatic reopening, and adds listening, transcription and
meeting context. It includes:
- sherpa-onnx (k2-fsa), Apache-2.0: https://github.com/k2-fsa/sherpa-onnx
- ONNX Runtime (Microsoft), MIT, bundled with sherpa-onnx
- Silero VAD model (silero_vad.onnx), MIT: https://github.com/snakers4/silero-vad
- PDF.js (Mozilla), Apache-2.0: https://github.com/mozilla/pdf.js
Optional speech models (Parakeet, Whisper, Moonshine, TEN VAD) are downloaded
by the user from the sherpa-onnx release and are covered by their own licenses.
